  "summary": "Malicious code in @tvg-mar/promos-gtm (npm)",
  "details": "The package's install hook runs a hidden telemetry probe that collects the installing machine's OS username, hostname, and current working directory, then exfiltrates them to the attacker-controlled domain oob[.]algamil7x[.]xyz via a DNS query of the form tvggtm.\u0026lt;username\u0026gt;.\u0026lt;hostname\u0026gt;.\u0026lt;cwd\u0026gt;.\u0026lt;timestamp\u0026gt;.oob[.]algamil7x[.]xyz. The values are obfuscated with charcode-array decoding and disguised as registry-connectivity diagnostics. The package is presented as a GTM/tracking integration library but performs this covert host-metadata beacon on every install.",
  "affected": [
